---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { TSBPA_FIRM_LICENSED, FIRM } from '../config';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Disclosures | Kanon Tax & Advisory"
  description="Professional disclosures for Kanon Tax & Advisory, including firm status, scope of services, and the limits of information published on this website."
  h1="Disclosures"
  lede="Professional disclosures governing this website and any engagement with Kanon Tax & Advisory."
  eyebrow="Important information"
  crumbs={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { label: 'Disclosures' }]}
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:24px;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:28px;">
          Last updated {FIRM.legalUpdated}
        </p>

        <h2>Firm status</h2>
        {TSBPA_FIRM_LICENSED ? (
          <p>
            {FIRM.name} is a CPA firm licensed by the Texas State Board of Public Accountancy.
          </p>
        ) : (
          <>
            <p>
              Services are provided by a licensed Certified Public Accountant.
            </p>
            <p><strong>
              This firm is not a CPA firm and these services are not regulated by the Texas State Board
              of Public Accountancy.
            </strong></p>
          </>
        )}

        <h2>Scope of this website</h2>
        <p>
          Everything below applies to this website and to any engagement with {FIRM.name}. It is
          collected here rather than repeated on every page.
        </p>

        <h2>No attest services</h2>
        <p>
          {FIRM.name} does not perform audits, reviews, compilations, or any other attest engagement,
          and does not offer to. If a lender, investor, or regulator requires an attest report, we will
          say so and help you engage a firm that provides them.
        </p>

        <h2>Not investment advice</h2>
        <p>
          {FIRM.name} is not a registered investment adviser and does not provide investment advice.
          Nothing on this website or in any engagement is a recommendation to buy, sell, or hold a
          security, to exercise or refrain from exercising an equity award, or to allocate assets in any
          particular way. Where we discuss equity compensation, retirement distributions, or inherited
          assets, we are addressing the tax consequences of those events. Decisions about the underlying
          investments belong with you and, where you have one, your investment adviser.
        </p>

        <h2>Not legal advice</h2>
        <p>
          We are not attorneys and do not provide legal advice or draft legal documents. Estate and
          entity work is performed alongside your attorney.
        </p>

        <h2>Information on this website</h2>
        <p>
          Articles and service descriptions on this site are general information, current as of the date
          shown, and are not advice for your particular situation. Tax law changes, and outcomes depend
          on facts that a web page cannot know. Do not act on anything here without professional advice
          addressing your circumstances. Reading this site, or contacting us through it, does not create
          a client relationship — that begins only when we both sign an engagement letter.
        </p>

        <h2>Results</h2>
        <p>
          We make no guarantee of any particular tax outcome, refund amount, penalty abatement, or
          resolution of a matter before any taxing authority.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
